# P-4: explicit equivalent of x1
seed 12345
dimension 2
global gridcut 0.0
boundary p p p
create_box 0 4 0 4 -0.5 0.5
create_grid 4 4 1
balance_grid rcb cell
species air.species N
mixture air N
global nrho 1.0 fnum 0.1
create_particles air n 100
compute 1 grid all air n
compute p ke/particle
variable a1 particle x
variable a2 particle y
custom particle create a float 2 set a[1] v_a1 air NULL set a[2] v_a2 air NULL
dump 1 image all 10 i.x2.*.ppm p_a[1] p_a[2]
run 0
